{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1632a89b88532ac0b05df796eb909873767bd750ab3c68d25037ab60970e35d0","ja":"ナイスバディになるために","zh":"为了拥有火辣身材","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"26c517e1941bdabdaca3433441e47606593fa8636a976e92fec16f61f8e48f23","ja":"ね～、いいっしょ～？　ふたりも一緒に\n旅館でゴロゴロしようよ～！","zh":"呐～，好不好嘛～？你们两个也一起\n在旅馆里懒洋洋地待着嘛～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1c868b50270caea0c06d39a8f801bbbc5c2acca565330203b2da212382ad0147","ja":"わ、私も泊まってみたいけど……明日は移動で\nお仕事もあるし、む、難しいんじゃないかな……？","zh":"我、我也想住住看就是了……不过明天还要赶路\n而且也有工作，恐、恐怕不太行吧……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ea58eb7a27aa750999ead38b65947c3a20afe840158879ac4aed725a6838d9e2","ja":"お仕事はお仕事で頑張ればなんとかなるって！　亜美が\nナイスバディになるために、お泊りが必要なんだよ～！","zh":"工作只要努力去干总会有办法的啦！亚美为了\n变成好身材，必须要去过夜才行嘛～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"9e42c0ab448a686cb9fec4eeb1fc1b8089ced2440cc4533a9bbd1c9e27711660","ja":"そ、そんなこと言われても……。","zh":"就算你这么说……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"81b16cee90697d9852be2f33aee336546650bdf48acc1956404dae24c22952f4","ja":"お待ちなさい、亜美。\nはたして、それが最善の方法でしょうか？","zh":"等一下，亚美。\n那真的是最好的办法吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e6ae81f472cc20c50f45603f11de8fe57a970aa70b62e5b7d7de59b57ab152c0","ja":"へっ！？　どういうこと？","zh":"诶！？　这是怎么回事？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"10c43765d4704367dc4f3820f1fb36ee0d8ed5c0ad659160e21e10e524ae7329","ja":"耳にしたことがあるはずです。\n『寝る子はよく育つ』、と。","zh":"你一定听说过这样一句话。\n那就是——“能睡的孩子长得快”。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"f02ab5fff0129e385bdd689c8dade3d581ed2c0fbbccf7c918d3f4ca525872fc","ja":"亜美も自室で毎日しっかり寝ることで、\nないすばでぃに近づけるのではないでしょうか？","zh":"亚美是不是也可以通过每天在自己房间里好好睡觉，\n来向魔鬼身材迈进一步呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"ae693f4ae5a173b349bef71e1d91e9fd612e492a63b6ee7159a59bdf57e77fc1","ja":"！　じゃあ今の亜美に一番必要なのは……\nお家でぐっすり眠るってこと！？","zh":"！　那现在亚美最需要的……\n岂不是在家里好好睡上一觉！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"7d289342e0951ac71814b6abb91769f2fa79662e8c78451927b3c028037c2984","ja":"わ、私も、そう思うよ……♪\nだから、きょ、今日は、帰った方が……。","zh":"我、我也这么觉得哦……♪\n所以，今、今天还是回去比较……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"f59e5e3d97d0f1730864b510659d57352b3d814945fd294287cbd4332544b604","ja":"はい。温泉で温まった体を冷やさないうちに、\n速やかに帰宅しましょう。","zh":"好的。趁着泡完温泉暖和的身子还没变凉，\n快点回家吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"de6037dfbafb2050502a299d2bb4449760e0c73fa326ba5a4effded6e3f0eaf2","ja":"わかった！　了解だよ！\nじゃあみんなで帰ろっか～♪","zh":"明白！了解啦！\n那大家就一起回去吧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4bc533efcd8a222018099df90687d0a3b153cfc57f429e86da4d0a330f7cf217","ja":"ええ、それでは……。","zh":"好的，那么……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"120a6bdba22725c49d450992758b08489e064e85f83842abe6edbf5632e1b89d","ja":"……あれ？　よく寝ればいいだけだったら、\n旅館でよかったんじゃないの？","zh":"……咦？要是只要好好睡一觉就行的话，\n住旅馆不就好了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1160.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"db2f97bd7e9d26cf92cfaa010fa7fe2d2d7194269b15d3db093cae6c710b0ec9","ja":"亜美……言いくるめられた～っ！？\nちょ、ちょっと待ってよ！　スト～ップ！","zh":"亚美……被你说服了～！？\n等等，等一下啦！停——下！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
